#ASSERT (`Under Article 8(1), as a controller, does the processing of the child's personal data meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE FALSE 5 FALSE 0 FALSE) EQUALS (`Under Article 8(1), as a data subject, does the processing of my personal data as a child meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE FALSE 5 FALSE 0 FALSE)
