-- MIRROR 8_1n: JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`Under Article 8(1), as a controller, is the consent of the holder of parental responsibility needed for my processing` TRUE TRUE 12 TRUE 13) EQUALS (`Under Article 8(1), as a data subject, is the consent of my parent or guardian (the holder of parental responsibility) needed for the processing of my personal data` TRUE TRUE 12 TRUE 13)
