-- MIRROR 9_12: JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of this category of personal data prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 controller answer: no`) EQUALS (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a data subject, is the processing of this category of personal data about me prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 subject answer: no`)
-- MIRROR 9_12: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of this category of personal data prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 controller answer: yes`) EQUALS (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a data subject, is the processing of this category of personal data about me prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 subject answer: yes`)
-- MIRROR 9_12: NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of this category of personal data prohibited` `Art 9(1) other personal data` `P1 controller answer: no`) EQUALS (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a data subject, is the processing of this category of personal data about me prohibited` `Art 9(1) other personal data` `P1 subject answer: no`)
-- MIRROR 9_12: NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of this category of personal data prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 controller answer: not sure`) EQUALS (`Under Article 9(1) and (2), as a data subject, is the processing of this category of personal data about me prohibited` `Art 9(1) data concerning health` `P1 subject answer: not sure`)
